{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/338787-items-out-of-nothing","id":338787,"title":"Items out of nothing","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-13T00:08:26-08:00","id":338787,"title":"Items out of nothing","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/337310-bale-hounds-and-uratha-traditions\">My PCs Alpha want to duel with Bale Hounds leader</a>. Of course NPC plan to cheat. One of simplest way is to make him take in the middle of combat a silver weapon, when PC will fight only with his claws. I looked in the corebook and could not find a Gift or ability to let take an items out of nowhere, like from <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/HammerSpace\" target=\"_blank\">Hammer Space</a>. Is there something like this in 1ed?<br /> <br /> Maybe all that is need is Rite of Dedication? Can a silver items be Dedicated?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T00:14:00-08:00","id":338804,"title":"","content":"Use a fetish. It's totally possible in W:tF to make a Bag of Endless Holding, and as it has endless holding, you can make it as tiny as you want. Pendant pouch ahoy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T01:32:18-08:00","id":338850,"title":"","content":"I would rather make it, exactly, taking it out of thin air. It <b>should</b> feel as cheating. Maybe some Maeljin Investment, if nothing others comes to mind?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T04:40:09-08:00","id":338933,"title":"","content":"The NPC could use a Skinsheath fetish, as listed on page 54 of War Against the Pure. This is a scar fetish in the rough form om the weapon that can contain the weapon itself, making it fade into nothingness. With a reflexive activation roll the character can draw the weapon from the scar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T10:02:08-08:00","id":339171,"title"